research/journal/experiments/2026-11-07-fly-connections-memory.md:19:The existing v1 chess-looking association failed: all arms had identical choices, and sensory input drove PAM08 even without feedback. The next proposal must prevent that false control without silently subtracting or relabelling neural signals. Gkanias-derived `ReversalMemory` is a source-derived computational rule, not measured receptor dynamics. Local APL inhibition and persistent synaptic storage are separate evidence questions.
