documentation/design/neural-learning/fly-connections-memory-v1-revision-2-2026-11-07.md:83:## 7. Remaining build/launch boundaries
documentation/design/neural-learning/fly-connections-memory-v1-revision-2-2026-11-07.md:87:No build follows until strict review explicitly allows this revised source/design. The key question is whether actual local PAM07 activity with the disclosed published negative DPR branch is a sufficient biological justification for P1, not whether extra-circuit arithmetic can be renamed. If a necessary source fact still cannot be resolved, record it and use the researcher's honest-stop condition. Do not weaken P1 to engineered-memory success.
